  "body_html": "<h1>Basic Auction Formats</h1>\n<p>The basic auction layer defines single-item and multi-item transfer-auction\nformats. Multi-item feasibility records that no item is allocated to two\ndistinct agents.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, def:auction_basic_formats] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
